    "author_role": "nursing",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-25T22:40",
    "text": "Pt resting, husband at bedside. NS infusing at 125 mL/h. No emesis since arrival on unit; one loose watery stool at 20:15. Tolerating clear liquids and crackers. Orthostatic vitals: lying BP 118/66 HR 88, standing BP 104/60 HR 102, mildly lightheaded on standing; fall precautions and call light within reach. Voided 300 mL concentrated urine."
   },
   {
    "id": "d4",
