    "text": "HOSPITAL DAY 3\n\nS: No vomiting since admission, one loose stool yesterday. Eating soft diet.\nO: HR 78, BP 132/76, orthostatics negative. Mucosa moist.\n\nAssessment/Plan:\n1. AKI - prerenal, resolving, Cr 1.0.\n2. Hyponatremia - corrected, Na 137.\n3. Viral gastroenteritis - resolving.\n4. T2DM, HTN - resume home meds at discharge if Cr stable."
