    "text": "DISCHARGE SUMMARY\nAdmit: 09/25/2026   Discharge: 09/28/2026   Disposition: Home with husband\n\nDISCHARGE DIAGNOSES:\n1. Acute kidney injury, prerenal, due to dehydration from viral gastroenteritis - resolved\n2. Hypovolemic hyponatremia - resolved\n3. Viral gastroenteritis\n4. Type 2 diabetes mellitus\n5. Hypertension\n6. Hyperlipidemia\n\nHOSPITAL COURSE: IV normal saline with steady improvement; Cr 2.3 -> 0.9, Na 128 -> 138. GI symptoms resolved by HD2. Metformin and lisinopril/HCTZ resumed at discharge.\n\nFOLLOW-UP: PCP in 1 week with BMP."
